## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

This is a fully hand-written "list" data source (not generated by
`tfplugingen-framework`, which has no such concept) wrapping
`GET /sources/v1/{sourceId}/provisioning-policies` (`golang-sdk/v3`'s
`sources.SourcesAPIService.ListProvisioningPoliciesV1`), mirroring
`identitynow_roles_v1`'s established pattern. It reuses
`identitynow_source_provisioning_policy_v1`'s generated schema/model types
for each list element - see that resource's "Known Limitations & Live
Testing Notes" section for the full v1-vs-v2 rationale and `fields`
JSON-string modeling, which apply identically to every policy returned
here. Phase B (live testing against a real sandbox tenant) is complete for
the parent resource - see that section for details.
